{"text": "<p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">0:00</span> This sentence belongs to the first tone, 440 hertz.</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1\">0:01</span> This one belongs to the second tone, 550 hertz.</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2\">0:02</span> Third tone, 660 hertz. A café, an étude.</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3\">0:03</span> The fourth and last tone is 880 hertz.</p>", "media": "tone4.wav", "media-source": "", "media-time": 2.0}
